OL,3,APoundland's future hangs in the balance
OL,4,Aas chain edges towards collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe future of Poundland hangs in the
OL,7,Fbalance as the discount chain edges
OL,8,Ftowards collapse, the BBC understands.
OL,10,FThe retailer has filed a notice of
OL,11,Fintention to appoint administrators,
OL,12,Fwhich if approved by the High Court,
OL,13,Fwill give the business 10 days
OL,14,Fbreathing space to find a rescue deal.
OL,16,FPoundland's managing director Barry
OL,17,FWilliams wrote a memo to his 12,000
OL,18,Fstaff across its 600 stores in the UK
OL,19,Fand Ireland saying the American owner
OL,20,Fof the chain had limited the chain's
OL,21,Faccess to funding.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,0,100
